---
---

<section class="case-feature" aria-label="Caso destacado">
  <div class="case-inner">
    <!-- Image side -->
    <div class="case-image-wrap reveal-left">
      <div class="case-image-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="case-image-overlay"></div>
        <span class="case-image-text">Imagen del caso</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text side -->
    <div class="case-text reveal-right">
      <div class="case-text-inner">
        <div class="case-meta">
          <span class="eyebrow">Caso Destacado</span>
          <span class="case-sector">Industria financiera&nbsp;·&nbsp;Reputación institucional</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="case-headline">
          Cuando el silencio ya no era una opción, construimos el relato que faltaba.
        </h2>

        <div class="case-body">
          <p>
            Una institución financiera con décadas de trayectoria enfrentaba
            una crisis de confianza sin haber cometido un error evidente.
          </p>
          <p>
            El problema era narrativo. La solución también.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="/casos" class="arrow-link">Leer el caso</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .case-feature {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .case-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    min-height: 580px;
  }

  /* ── Image ── */
  .case-image-wrap {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .case-image-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-color: #1e2c22;
    background-image: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e2c22 0%, #0e1a13 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .case-image-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent 70%, var(--color-bg-secondary) 100%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .case-image-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(240, 236, 228, 0.3);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* ── Text ── */
  .case-text {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-80) var(--space-64);
  }

  .case-text-inner {
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .case-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-32);
  }

  .case-sector {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .case-headline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-32);
  }

  .case-body {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-40);
  }

  .case-body p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .case-body p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
  }

  /* ── Mobile ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .case-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .case-image-wrap {
      height: 320px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .case-image-placeholder {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
    }

    .case-image-overlay {
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 70%, var(--color-bg-secondary) 100%);
    }

    .case-text {
      padding: var(--space-48) var(--gutter);
    }

    .case-text-inner {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
